      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "1. synchronize怎么用，底层实现？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "synchronized用于方法或代码块，保证线程安全。底层通过JVM的Monitor机制实现，锁升级包括偏向锁、轻量级锁、重量级锁，以提高性能。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "2. reentranlock的区别？底层知道吗？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "ReentrantLock比synchronized更灵活，支持公平锁、非公平锁，提供锁超时机制。底层通过AQS（AbstractQueuedSynchronizer）和CAS操作实现。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 5
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "3. 设计模式，手撕单例",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 6
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u7",
      "position": 7,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "单例模式常用的实现方式包括懒汉式、饿汉式、双重检查锁定、静态内部类。双重检查锁定使用volatile确保线程安全。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 7
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u8",
      "position": 8,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "4. 用了volatile是为什么？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 8
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u9",
      "position": 9,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "volatile保证变量的可见性，防止多个线程读取到缓存中的旧值，确保对变量的修改对其他线程立即可见，不保证原子性。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 9
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u10",
      "position": 10,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "5. collection分类，以及介绍",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 10
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u11",
      "position": 11,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "集合框架包括List、Set、Map三大接口。List用于有序集合，Set用于无序但不重复集合，Map用于键值对存储，常见实现类有ArrayList、HashSet、HashMap等。\nJava并发与多线程",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 11
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u12",
      "position": 12,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "6. 乐观锁，可重入锁？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 12
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u13",
      "position": 13,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "乐观锁通过CAS操作假设不会有冲突，常用于低冲突场景。可重入锁允许同一线程多次获得锁，常用于递归或嵌套调用中。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 13
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u14",
      "position": 14,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "7. 向面试官介绍了 synchronized锁升级，volatile内存语意以及从底层解释如何实现可见性，cas的原理，lock，以及condition队列，并且问我是否自己写过并发代码",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 14
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u15",
      "position": 15,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "synchronized锁升级优化了性能，volatile保证变量的可见性，CAS通过硬件指令实现原子操作，ReentrantLock结合Condition用于线程间通信。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 15
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u16",
      "position": 16,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "8. 使用AB线程以及AB两个锁，手写死锁例子，如何避免死锁",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 16
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u17",
      "position": 17,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "死锁发生在多个线程循环等待资源。避免死锁可以通过资源的有序获取、加锁时使用tryLock和超时机制来解决。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 17
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u18",
      "position": 18,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "9. 多个线程使用CAS竞争失败了怎么办？使用for循环重新竞争",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e25d4b8d5ce91bf54d295ddc9619bad3dc16f51b2dc0e37859c9897e823d9d4a",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "464dfbe366e8401f7642d7565a2ecca92bb6d3627928bbd2b0507319e73f0c5b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 18
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:66e1032f000000000c019cd8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-19:u19",
      "position": 19,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "CAS竞争失败时可以通过for循环重试，但如果竞争过多，可能导致CPU空转。可以结合自旋锁、锁机制或退避算法优化性能。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/66e1032f000000000c019cd8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
